        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana MP578, Medium Edge Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Medium Modern Edge Cabinet Pull is perfect for contemporary kitchens. Its small profile and stylish finish choices make it a great choice to update any lightweight door or drawer. It is easy to install and comes packaged with all the necessary hardware. It has 5-1/16 inch mounting centers. This Medium Hidden Cabinet Pull can be mounted horizontally or vertically for use on kitchen cabinet doors or drawers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MP578-specifications.gif?v=1704354710\" width=\"600\" height=\"172\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana MP578 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/2-15-16-inch-modern-hidden-cabinet-pull-deltana-mp21516\"><b>Deltana MP21516 Small Edge Cabinet Pull</b></a> and\r\n<a href=\"/products/large-modern-hidden-cabinet-pull-deltana-mp9116\"><b>Deltana MP9116 Large Edge Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MP578-installed.jpg?v=1704352953\" width=\"271\" height=\"248\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Deltana MP578 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Length: 5-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 5-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed either vertically or horizontally.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MP578-specifications.pdf?v=1704262341\"><b>Deltana MP578 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
